ind":"update","title":"Demo v0.8.1 Update","summary":"Steam Next Fest is here, and the demo has a new update for it. Your save carries over. New shearing music The shed now plays \"Knees Up\" by Breabach, a Scottish folk band, while you shear. More new tracks on the way for the full release 🎧. Between sheep the music settles down rather than stopping, and when you come back to shear it picks up where it left off. Smoother walking The farmer and your dog now walk in smooth lines and curves instead of stepping tile to tile, and stop exactly where you c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:19:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690467","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4714850-1846018067945351","game_id":"steam-4714850","kind":"update","title":"Sheepscape - Demo v0.6.2 Update","summary":"The demo is now playable in nine more languages: Japanese, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Spanish, Brazilian Portuguese, Russian, Polish and Ukrainian. These are all of the languages I'm planning to launch with on 5 November. Your save carries over. Languages The game starts in your Steam language, or your computer's, if it's one of the ten. You can change it any time in Settings > Display > Language, where each language is listed in its own name. Japanese and Chinese have their own pixel f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T21:21:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067945351","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4714850-1846018067930228","game_id":"steam-4714850","kind":"update","title":"Sheepscape - Demo v0.6.1 Update","summary":"Thank you to everyone who has played the demo so far, filled in the feedback form, or made a video ❤️. There were some common themes: the wait between shears was boring, sheep got stuck in corners, the first shears were slow and punishing, and nobody could find how to sell a sheep. This update is about all of that. There's quite a bit in this one 😅. Your save carries over. The smallholding has grown a border, and your flock, your money and your progress are all kept. Something to do between shea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T15:46:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930228","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4714850-1844751498235135","game_id":"steam-4714850","kind":"announcement","title":"The free demo is out now 🐑","summary":"The free Sheepscape demo is out now on Steam. You start with five muddy sheep on a Welsh smallholding and one dog, and you've got about an hour to build them into a flock good enough to buy your next farm. Play the free demo If you played the Playtest or sent feedback since 0.3.6: thank you 🙏. This is the biggest update yet, and it's the build the demo launches with. There's one change I want to explain properly first, because some of you have been enjoying it. Why Home Farm is no longer in the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T18:19:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498235135","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4714850-1844751498218225","game_id":"steam-4714850","kind":"update","title":"Sheepscape - Playtest v0.3.6 Patch","summary":"Thank you for everything you've sent in over the playtest period ❤️. One message came through louder than the rest: being able to see the pressure is what made herding click. So this update keeps the radar for good, and carries on making the numbers on your sheep make sense. The pressure radar stays on The red circle 🔴 around the farmer and your dog used to switch itself off after your first couple of round-ups. It now stays on for good, because it turned out to be the thing that makes herding r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T12:00:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218225","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4714850-1844115010497274","game_id":"steam-4714850","kind":"update","title":"Sheepscape - Playtest v0.3.5 Patch","summary":"Thank you for everything you have sent in since v0.3.4 and previously. The clearest message was that the first hour asked too much: how to move, how to shear, what to do next. This update is mostly about that. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46159911/54d288202811c6c76ba14b7bdee85295743e0736.jpg Knowing what to do next An objectives list 📋. A clipboard slides out from the left when the farm has something new for you, writes it in pencil, and ticks it off when it’s done. Each farm has its own list, and it teac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T14:43:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010497274","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4714850-1843481262704618","game_id":"steam-4714850","kind":"update","title":"Sheepscape - Playtest v0.3.4 Patch","summary":"Thank you for all the feedback from the first few weeks of the playtest. This is a big one 😅 and a lot bigger than I would like for a patch but it was needed. A lot of it came straight from watching you play, reading feedback (❤️ 🙏), and the rest came from finding out what winter was missing. The big ones Winter now bites ❄️. Grass grows with the seasons, so a winter field barely grows at all and you will need feed to get through it. Across the whole year there is the same amount of grass as bef","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T13:34:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262704618","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4714850-1842212951296312","game_id":"steam-4714850","kind":"announcement","title":"The first playable Sheepscape playtest is open 🐑","summary":"Sheepscape has reached the point I have been building toward since I started five months ago: a version you can play from the first sheep to the day you buy your second farm. It has the whole year in it: lambing, shearing, a market and a winter that will take sheep off you if you're not paying attention. The last part is why I am opening a playtest rather than plugging at it some more. I've been balancing the numbers, but that's me playing it as a solo dev who's been head down in it from the sta","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T09:17:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951296312","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4714850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:40:15Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:40:15Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4714850":"2026-10-26T13:40:15Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4714850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:40:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:40:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:40:15Z"},"5226520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:40:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:40:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:40:15Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4714850","app_id":4714850,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:53Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"da45ce2b9d5f8e27568574a93f6faf2410a01f5b9844c3051c834e1c4a6caaa3","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Sheepscape is a cozy, focused sheep-farming sim. Send your dog to round up the flock, shear them in a hands-on minigame, then sell the wool and breed a finer flock season after season. It's the whole craft of shepherding: from your first muddy field to the open highlands.","publishers":[{"name":"Lemur Tango Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Lemur Tango Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793890800,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Sheepscape - Demo Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792422688","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4714850/114984321/4a52380edbc9e3e51ff0f37aa439f87c9474cd69/1792422303/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4714850/114984321/4a52380edbc9e3e51ff0f37aa439f87c9474cd69/1792422303/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4714850/114984321/4a52380edbc9e3e51ff0f37aa439f87c9474cd69/1792422303/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"4714850/114984321/4a52380edbc9e3e51ff0f37aa439f87c9474cd69/1792422303/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"4714850/114984321/4a52380edbc9e3e51ff0f37aa439f87c9474cd69/1792422303/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257469053/207980b01f0fc75223d6ee9dfa7d9ead41dad246/movie_600x33